# Holding A builds on: a road ahead of him as he walks (facing south-east, along his row), then a row of roads beside
# him (facing north-east while walking south-east), the D-pad pushed a little wrong (right only) staying on the row.
tp 12 60
wait 10
key X
hold DOWN+RIGHT 2
hold A+DOWN+RIGHT 80
wait 10
shot c00-road-ahead
tp 12 66
wait 10
hold UP+RIGHT 2
hold A+RIGHT 90
wait 10
shot c01-row-beside
log
